			"Message": "fix(package): add missing browserslist dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "15a6262188ff5c6d8d94446cde9c2c7cefffcccd"
		},
